WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:06.010
A tsunami brought by the eruption oft the
volcano Krakatao has left this costal village

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:08.920
called Lentera behind me in rubble.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:14.160
It is in this rubble that a young father hopes
he will find his three month old baby who

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.980
has been missing since Saturday.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:20.470
The baby girl's name is Annisa.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.000
Her body could be somewhere in this debris.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.300
Ferry Kurniawan, a fisherman, is her father.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.770
He lived with his wife Hanna and their three
children near the water's edge.

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:36.870
Their bamboo hut couldn't withstand the force
of the giant wave.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:41.570
"This is all that's left of our house.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:46.000
My mother asked about the strange sound outside
and when I looked out, I saw 3 big waves,

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.000
one after the other.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.650
I panicked and woke up my wife.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:50.850
We ran out with the whole family.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.719
This (points to his right side) is where I
got hit by the first wave, but we kept running.

00:00:54.719 --> 00:00:57.180
Over there (points to his left side) came
the second wave.

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:01.150
We fell again...and that's when our baby was
torn from my wife's arms.

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:08.320
We're still looking for her."

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:14.359
In this small village of about 50 residents,
three people were unaccounted for.

00:01:14.359 --> 00:01:17.909
Two bodies have been found.

00:01:17.909 --> 00:01:22.999
But Ferry’s baby girl is still missing.

00:01:22.999 --> 00:01:31.060
This home is where Ferry and Hanna reunited
with two of their children instead of three.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:37.700
"My baby was just wearing the new clothes
I had bought for her.

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:44.299
She had some new toys too, and she had just
started to smile and laugh.

00:01:44.299 --> 00:01:49.310
We wanted to go to a family gathering but
when the waves came, I couldn't hold onto

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:52.729
her tight enough.

00:01:52.729 --> 00:02:01.579
I lost her.

00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:06.500
The tsunami left Hanna and Ferry's family
with only the clothes on their backs.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:13.500
And for now, all they have is this picture of Annisa and the hope that she will be found.

